"""Original MC68000 architectural guest vectors. MIT: adjacent LICENSE.

M68000PRM integer instruction descriptions (68000 entries only). Values and CCR
are source-authored; they are never sampled from this or another emulator.
None excludes flags the manual leaves undefined, rather than inventing a golden.
"""
